{"alias":"/funding/gpa/eps/reports","title":"EPS Reports and Presentations","changed":"2026-05-13T12:54:21+00:00","before":"<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Reviews &amp; Analyses</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Amended LD 2226 Analysis Documents</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">\r\n\t<h4>LD 2226 — An Act to Amend the Essential Programs and Services School Funding Formula</h4>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>Note:</strong> The changes in LD 2226 will not be implemented until the FY 2028 EPS school funding calculations. The following analysis uses FY 2027 data solely as an example of what the results may have looked like if the provisions of LD 2226 had been in effect during the FY 2027 EPS calculations. Actual impacts in FY 2028 will vary based on the data collected and used in the FY 2028 EPS funding calculations.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Amended%20LD%202226%20Summary%20Results%20with%20Details%20-%204.8.2026.pdf\">Summary Results with Details</a> (April 8, 2026)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Amended%20LD%202226%20Step%201%20Regional%20Index%20Changes%20by%20SAU%20-%204.9.2026.pdf\">Step 1: Regional Index Changes by SAU</a> (April 9, 2026)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Amended%20LD%202226%20Step%202%20Poverty%20Factor%2010%25%20Variable%20Mill%20Rates%20by%20SAU%20-%204.9.2026.pdf\">Step 2: Poverty Factor 10% with Variable Local Share Mill Rates by SAU</a> (April 9, 2026)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Amended%20LD%202226%20Step%203%20Hold%20Harmless%20Amoun